Third-party market data
-----------------------
The market data shown by this software is retrieved at runtime from public
third-party sources (Yahoo Finance, Kraken, Coinbase, Swissquote, gold-api) and
public RSS feeds. It is not redistributed with this repository, and each
source's own terms of use apply to its use.

Not investment advice
---------------------
This software produces automated technical analysis. It is not investment
advice, and it makes no guarantee of any outcome. Indicator agreement is a
measure of agreement between rules, not a probability of profit.
